Subject to the other terms of this license and any specific license for a work, the project content may be used with artificial intelligence or machine learning systems for training, pretraining, fine-tuning, evaluation, inference, retrieval-augmented use, translation, proofreading, timing, format conversion, subtitle generation, and related assistance. Models, analyses, or derivative content produced through such use must not imply official approval or endorsement by Billion Meta Lab. Users remain responsible for ensuring that their inputs, outputs, and publication activities comply with applicable law and third-party rights.

